    {
      "fileName": "switcheroo.json",
      "id": "RG6PAQuPho2MWdmZ",
      "name": "Switcheroo",
      "img": "icons/sundries/books/book-red-exclamation.webp",
      "type": "feat",
      "data": {
        "_id": "RG6PAQuPho2MWdmZ",
        "folder": "LwQYVo8HbQp58xYp",
        "img": "icons/sundries/books/book-red-exclamation.webp",
        "name": "Switcheroo",
        "system": {
          "actionType": {
            "value": "reaction"
          },
          "actions": {
            "value": null
          },
          "category": "class",
          "description": {
            "value": "<p><strong>Trigger</strong> You are targeted by a ranged attack.</p>\n<p><strong>Requirements</strong> You are adjacent to an enemy and have @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.classfeatures.Item.Panache].</p><hr /><p>You attempt to deftly swap places with an adjacent enemy to avoid the attack. Choose an adjacent enemy and attempt to @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.Reposition] it. Instead of the normal results of Reposition, use the following.</p><hr /><p><strong>Critical Success</strong> You swap places with the target enemy and the enemy becomes the target of the triggering attack.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> As critical success, except the target has lesser cover against the triggering attack, and you lose your panache.</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> You lose your panache.</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> You become @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Off-Guard] against the triggering attack, and you lose your panache.</p>"
          },
          "level": {
            "value": 10
          },
          "prerequisites": {
            "value": []
          },
          "publication": {
            "license": "ORC",
            "remaster": true,
            "title": "Pathfinder Player Core 2"
          },
          "rules": [],
          "traits": {
            "rarity": "common",
            "value": [
              "swashbuckler"
            ]
          }
        },
        "type": "feat"
      },
      "level": 10,
      "category": "class"
    },
    {
      "fileName": "targeting-finisher.json",
      "id": "DLkMoVb8qb4qxnx3",
      "name": "Targeting Finisher",
      "img": "icons/sundries/books/book-red-exclamation.webp",
      "type": "feat",
      "data": {
        "_id": "DLkMoVb8qb4qxnx3",
        "folder": "LwQYVo8HbQp58xYp",
        "img": "icons/sundries/books/book-red-exclamation.webp",
        "name": "Targeting Finisher",
        "system": {
          "actionType": {
            "value": "action"
          },
          "actions": {
            "value": 1
          },
          "category": "class",
          "description": {
            "value": "<p>Your attack harms and hinders your foe. Choose a particular part of your foe from the list below and Strike.</p>\n<p>If you hit and damage the target, apply the effect corresponding to the chosen part. This hindrance lasts until the end of your next turn. On a critical hit, you also apply a lesser effect lasting for 1 minute.</p><ul><li><strong>Arm (or another limb used for attacks, such as a tentacle)</strong> The target is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Enfeebled]{Enfeebled 2}. On a critical hit, it is also @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Enfeebled]{Enfeebled 1} for 1 minute.</li><li><strong>Head</strong> The target is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Stupefied]{Stupefied 2}. On a critical hit, it is also @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Stupefied]{Stupefied 1} for 1 minute.</li><li><strong>Legs</strong> The target takes a –10-foot status penalty to its Speeds. On a critical hit, it also takes a –5-foot status penalty to its Speeds for 1 minute.</li></ul><p>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.feat-effects.Item.Effect: Targeting Finisher]</p>"
          },
          "level": {
            "value": 10
          },
          "prerequisites": {
            "value": []
          },
          "publication": {
            "license": "ORC",
            "remaster": true,
            "title": "Pathfinder Player Core 2"
          },
